OL,3,GNEWSABBC commentator thanks Cardiff
OL,4,ACity legend for saving him after heart
OL,5,Aattack scare
OL,6,
OL,7,FA football pundit has thanked his
OL,8,Fco-commentator for saving him when he
OL,9,Fhad a suspected heart attack after a
OL,10,Fgame.
OL,12,FRob Phillips had just finished covering
OL,13,FCardiff City's last-gasp defeat to
OL,14,FBolton earlier this month, when he
OL,15,Fstarted experiencing severe chest
OL,16,Fpains.
OL,18,FHe intended to drive home to south
OL,19,FWales from the Greater Manchester town,
OL,20,Fbut club legend Nathan Blake stepped in
OL,21,Fand said he wasn't going anywhere,
OL,22,Fseeing that he had lost all his colour.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
